{"2269120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Dark Side Of Mars", "steam_appid": 2269120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>STORY</strong><br>In the near future man has discovered a cave system on Mars. In it they found plant life but after testing the plants mysterious water source they accidentally unleashed a terrible disease. In The Dark Side Of Mars you play as the Red Arc Facility's head of security Mr Conroy and all you have to do is escape, by finding the key cards and space suit.<br><br><strong>GAME PLAY</strong><br>The Dark Side Of Mars is a survival horror game where you need to find your way though one big maze that is the Red Arc Facility. You need to Find four Key cards and one Space Suit to escape the facility alive. You can discover audio logs around the map revealing what really happened as you explore.<br><br>But be careful because something is roaming around and they kill anything human, some enemies run and some relentlessly follow you, loose sight of them to make them give up. All you have is a flash light, Your battery dies quickly and recharges slowly and so does your stamina.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>The game is one big maze so make sure you take notes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269120/extras/6546278e1c2c287b451f7c6128e69a57.avif?t=1674547284\" width=616 height=288 /></span><br>Sprint from danger!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269120/extras/f8eb37bc7633859e843ea648e7c09833.avif?t=1674547284\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>Duck under half open doors to escape!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269120/extras/11f011146a8ae5ec69f882a40d86ae3f.avif?t=1674547284\" width=616 height=346 /></span>